% Head-modifier compounds (e.g. 'garden dog') introduce an underspecified two-
% place 'compound' relation between the head's instance and the modifier's
% instance.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_Compounding/):
%   h0:compound[ARG1 x1, ARG2 x2]
%   h0:[ARG0 x1]
%   [ARG0 x2]

pattern { C [pred="compound"]; C -[1=ARG1]-> H; C -[1=ARG2]-> M }
